{"speciesId":218,"names":{"fr":"Limagma","es":"Slugma","en":"Slugma","ja":"マグマッグ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It never sleeps. It has to keep moving because if it stopped, its magma body would cool and harden."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"A common sight in volcanic areas, it slowly slithers around in a con­ stant search for warm places."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"These group to­ gether in areas that are hotter than normal. If it cools off, its skin hardens."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"Molten magma courses throughout SLUGMA’s circulatory system. If this POKéMON is chilled, the magma cools and hardens. Its body turns brittle and chunks fall off, reducing its size."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SLUGMA does not have any blood in its body. Instead, intensely hot magma circulates throughout this POKéMON’s body, carrying essential nutrients and oxygen to its organs."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is a species of POKéMON that lives in volcanic areas. If its body cools, its skin hardens and immobilizes it. To avoid that, it sleeps near magma."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"A common sight in volcanic areas, it slowly slithers around in a constant search for warm places."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It never sleeps. It has to keep moving because if it stopped, its magma body would cool and harden."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It never sleeps. It has to keep moving because if it stopped, its magma body would cool and harden."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"A common sight in volcanic areas, it slowly slithers around in a constant search for warm places."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son corps est fait de magma. S’il cesse de bouger, il refroidit et durcit."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps est fait de magma. S’il cesse de bouger, il refroidit et durcit."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Commun dans les régions volcaniques, il se déplace sans cesse pour trouver des endroits chauds."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Asiduo a las zonas volcánicas, se desliza lentamente en busca de lugares calientes."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A common sight in volcanic areas, it slowly slithers around in a constant search for warm places."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"火山地帯に 多く 発生。 暖かい ところを 探して のろのろ はいずり回っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps est fait de magma. S’il cesse de bouger, il refroidit et durcit."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su cuerpo se compone de magma. Si deja de moverse, se enfría y se endurece."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"溶岩で できた 体を 持つ。 絶えず 動いていないと 体が 冷えて 固まってしまうのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Du magma en fusion coule dans les veines de Limagma. Si ce Pokémon est refroidi, le magma se solidifie. Son corps devient alors cassant et des morceaux s’en détachent, diminuant ainsi sa taille."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Por el sistema circulatorio de Slugma corre magma líquido. Si este Pokémon se enfriara, el magma perdería el calor y se solidificaría, por lo que se resquebrajaría por completo, perdería algunos trozos y reduciría su tamaño."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Molten magma courses throughout Slugma’s circulatory system. If this Pokémon is chilled, the magma cools and hardens. Its body turns brittle and chunks fall off, reducing its size."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体の 中では 灼熱の 溶岩が 渦巻いているが 冷えると 固まって しまい 崩れて 体が 小さく なっていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les veines de Limagma ne contiennent pas de sang. Au lieu de ça, du magma en fusion circule dans le corps de ce Pokémon, apportant les nutriments et l’oxygène nécessaires à ses organes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Slugma no tiene sangre en su organismo, sino ardiente magma que hace circular por todo el cuerpo los nutrientes y el oxígeno que necesitan sus órganos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Slugma does not have any blood in its body. Instead, intensely hot magma circulates throughout this Pokémon’s body, carrying essential nutrients and oxygen to its organs."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体の 中では 血液の かわりに 必要な 栄養と 酸素を 運ぶために 灼熱の マグマが 循環している。"}],"varieties":[{"id":218,"moves":[{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[3,"level-up",50],[4,"level-up",50],[5,"level-up",50],[6,"level-up",50],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",50],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",46],[9,"level-up",46],[10,"level-up",46],[11,"level-up",46],[12,"level-up",50],[13,"level-up",50],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"level-up",46],[15,"level-up",46],[16,"level-up",41],[17,"level-up",41],[18,"level-up",41],[23,"level-up",41],[25,"level-up",41],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name"